    "details": {
      "alignment": "Chaotic Evil",
      "type": {
        "value": "construct",
        "subtype": "studio copy"
      },
      "cr": 4,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Evil Mario.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, hand-authored from the article. no XP ledger entry; archetype default → CR 4 as a boss. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The Actor in the Cape</strong> — The Nintendo Mania studio — cast, under a Director</p><p>Status: Active — cape destroyed, leaf burned, fire sprinkled, ice CUT; survived every form, and pointed the survivors at the Director's exit</p><p>The corrupted Mario who stepped out of the studio's television, wearing a cape of shadowy pixelated feathers and moving like a special effect. Fought to music. Froze at the word CUT. Outlived the show that employed him.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Special-Effect Stomp</strong> — “The corrupted Mario who stepped out of the studio's television, wearing a cape of shadowy pixelated feathers and moving like a special effect.”</li><li><strong>Fire Form</strong> — “His costume rack: the pixelated feather cape (power source, yanked off by Luigi in a V-formation dive), a tanuki leaf that brought a fox tail and a second, grinning Wario head, a fire form, and an ice body with glowing”</li><li><strong>Multiattack</strong> — “The corrupted Mario who stepped out of the studio's television, wearing a cape of shadowy pixelated feathers and moving like a special effect.”</li><li><strong>Costume Rack</strong> — “His costume rack: the pixelated feather cape (power source, yanked off by Luigi in a V-formation dive), a tanuki leaf that brought a fox tail and a second, grinning Wario head, a fire form, and an ice body with glowing”</li><li><strong>Pixelated Feather Cape</strong> — “His costume rack: the pixelated feather cape (power source, yanked off by Luigi in a V-formation dive), a tanuki leaf that brought a fox tail and a second, grinning Wario head, a fire form, and an ice body with glowing”</li><li><strong>Freezes at CUT</strong> — “Froze at the word CUT.”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/evil_mario</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/evil_mario</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
